    "displayName": "fsi-UASD-ExceptionApproval-Workflow",
    "description": "Manages dual-approval exception lifecycle for sharing violations. Implements sequential approval chain: Security team followed by Data Owner. Both must approve for the exception to be granted. Exceptions default to 90-day duration. Expiration scanning runs within the detector flow. Supports compliance with FINRA 4511/3110, SEC 17a-3/4, SOX 302/404. Part of the FSI Agent Governance — Unrestricted Agent Sharing Detector solution.",
